# Puzzle de Call! English glyph codes, shared by every codec (blocks.en_table adds the codec's control codes).
# Codes line up with the small 8x8 font (LZ 0x161FD0), which already has 0-9 A-Z a-z and some punctuation at these
# slots, so one encoded string shows in both fonts. Big-font glyphs: fonts/vwf.txt (tools/vwf.py); small-font glyphs
# the game lacks: fonts/small.txt. docs/re/vwf.md.
